      "representative_excerpt": "Another notable point for concern is price difference. Many online food delivery services will display the base cost, which is different than the establishment's own website. Additionally, places that offer their own delivery service in house will often be advertised on food delivery sites, and bear completely different pricing models for the exact same good...",
